# `apps/di` (Frappe v16, ERPNext v16, Python 3.14)

- Edit locally, deploy with `./ops/push-app.sh di`, prove `https://sheikhmahboob.com/` answers.
- `apps/frappe` and `apps/erpnext` are local-only clones with no remote. Do not edit them, do not
  `bench get-app` over them.
- DocType changes go through the JSON + a patch in `di/patches.txt`; never hand-edit the live DB.
- `encryption_key` in `site_config.json` decrypts every stored token. Never print, move or
  regenerate it.
- "Safe to retry" applies only to failures that provably never reached FBR (see `di/integrations`).
- Tests: `bench --site sheikhmahboob.com run-tests --app di` on the server only when asked.
